{"displayStem":"61세 여자가 구불결장 게실 농양으로 항생제와 영상유도 배액을 받았다. 배액일을 0일로 한 합성 CRP 자료와 현재 평가 결과는 다음과 같다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성 관찰값","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg class=\"c03-p6-crp\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 480\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"배액 후 시간에 따른 CRP 관찰값 비교\"><text x=\"22\" y=\"26\">CRP (mg/L)</text><path d=\"M70 60V310H525\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M70 310v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"341\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M161 310v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"161\" y=\"341\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M252 310v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"252\" y=\"341\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M343 310v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"343\" y=\"341\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><path d=\"M434 310v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"434\" y=\"341\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M525 310v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"525\" y=\"341\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><path d=\"M64 310h6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"55\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M64 230h6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"55\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><path d=\"M64 150h6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"55\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"end\">200</text><path d=\"M64 70h6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"55\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"end\">300</text><polyline points=\"70,102 161,174 252,230 343,182 434,118 525,94\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"102\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"161\" cy=\"174\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"230\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"343\" cy=\"182\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></ci